      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/CtizGHrwfYKaRxW5BABv58hFpGE9tQnFNT-I8TH_fGoI8B4onEPVK_KKSSE0C1hwyF3RGMrGwWs=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "The idea of fishing for your family and neighbors rather than selling the catch really stayed with me. Tokelau shows how an economy can be built around sharing, trust, and community instead of money.",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T01:46:21Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
