      "text": "I found myself thinking about how different dinner must feel there. One person brings in the catch, another family shares it, and nobody is keeping score at the end of the day. That kind of everyday generosity feels almost foreign to an American like me.",
      "likeCount": 0,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T01:45:45Z",
      "replyCount": 0,
      "replies": []
    },
